# Everything this repository holds is LF on every platform, so no diff and no
# gate ever reads a line ending as a change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The vendored upstream is compared byte for byte against a fresh clone by
# ci/verify-vendor.sh. Line-ending translation on checkout -- git's default on
# Windows -- rewrites every line and makes that comparison meaningless, so
# this tree is binary as far as git's text handling goes. This exception is
# BELOW the catch-all because the last matching pattern wins.
libs/JoltPhysics/** -text
